@startuml INT-02_StripeSimulated
title INT-02: Integración de Pago Simulado\nStripeSimulatedPaymentAdapter — dentro de checkout-service

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam roundcorner 10

package "checkout-service" {
    component "ProcessCheckoutUseCase" as uc
    interface "PaymentPort" as port
    component "StripeSimulatedPaymentAdapter\n[Adaptador simulado — SANDBOX]" as adapter
}

node "Stripe API Real\n[NO UTILIZADA]" as stripe_real #gray

uc --> port : executePayment(orderId, amount)
port <|.. adapter : implementa
adapter --> adapter : Thread.sleep(500ms)\n— simula latencia de red
adapter --> adapter : genera transactionId\n= \"stripe_sim_\" + UUID.randomUUID()
adapter --> adapter : retorna PaymentResult\n{ transactionId, success: true }

adapter -[#gray,dashed]-> stripe_real : [SIN LLAMADA REAL]

note right of adapter
  <b>StripeSimulatedPaymentAdapter</b>
  ─────────────────────────────────
  • Clase: infrastructure.adapter.out.payment
  • Prefijo transacción: stripe_sim_
  • Aprueba siempre en sandbox
  • 500ms delay simulado
  • No hay HTTP calls a api.stripe.com
  • No hay API keys de Stripe
  ─────────────────────────────────
  <b>Evidencia observada</b>:
  evidencias/pay-sim-01/
  checkout-service-stripe-simulated-logs.txt
  stripe_sim_8977603a-...-73
  stripe_sim_bad44647-...-c5
end note

note bottom of stripe_real
  <color:gray>Stripe API real está fuera del
  alcance del sandbox.
  En producción requeriría:
  - API keys de Stripe
  - Endpoint: api.stripe.com
  - Manejo de webhooks</color>
end note

@enduml
